# Ingest and geo

- Source files live in `data/raw/` and are gitignored. Never commit them.
- Every ingest script is idempotent. Re-running changes no row counts.
- Stream large CSVs. The UPRN file is GB-wide — never read it into memory.
- Reproject everything to EPSG:4326 at ingest. Never store 27700 and convert at query time.
- External APIs (Overpass) are called by scripts and scheduled jobs ONLY. Never from the app.
- Route generation is deterministic. No randomness, no solver, no optimisation.
  The same prop and visit_number must always produce an identical route.
- Attribution is required by licence: OS (OGL v3.0) and OpenStreetMap (ODbL).
  Do not remove the attribution line.